{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2230","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Optimal Purchase"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have a group of $$$n$$$ students who need access to an online course. Two types of access keys are available in the store:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Individual key:"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" costs $$$a$$$ dollars and gives access to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" student. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Group key:"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" costs $$$b$$$ dollars and gives access to a group of up to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"three"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" students inclusive. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A group key can also be used for fewer students (one or two), and its price does not change."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to determine the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" amount of money needed to provide access to the online course for all $$$n$$$ students."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case consists of one line containing three integers $$$n, a, b$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, a, b \\le 10^8$$$) — the number of students, the cost of an individual key, and the cost of a group key."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output one integer — the minimum amount of money needed to provide access to the online course for all $$$n$$$ students."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n5 10 25\n4 10 50\n1 20 15\n1 10 25\n100000000 100 290\n2 10 15\n300 1 1\n4 10 12\n11 10 20\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n45\n40\n15\n10\n9666666670\n15\n100\n22\n80\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, you can buy $$$1$$$ group key and $$$2$$$ individual keys."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, you can buy $$$4$$$ individual keys."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, you can buy $$$1$$$ group key."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"childre